<BaseLayout title="About — GeoSmart">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">The geologist behind GeoSmart</div><h1>About</h1></div></section>
  <section class="page"><div class="container profile">
    <div class="profile-photo">Your photo<br>goes here.</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="section-kicker">Hi, I'm Camila.</p>
      <h2>Geology, the subsurface and the stories hidden in rocks.</h2>
      <p>I am a geology undergraduate interested in subsurface geology, geophysics, sedimentology and energy resources. GeoSmart is my personal space for documenting the work I am most proud of and sharing what I learn along the way.</p>
      <h2>What I am exploring</h2>
      <ul><li>Subsurface and offshore geology</li><li>Geophysics and seismic interpretation</li><li>Sedimentology and geological reservoirs</li><li>GIS and spatial analysis</li><li>Scientific communication and outreach</li></ul>
      <h2>Academic path</h2>
      <p><strong>Universidad Complutense de Madrid</strong> — Geology</p>
      <p><strong>NTNU, Trondheim</strong> — Erasmus exchange, 2026–27</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
